## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical, production-grade use of eBPF/XDP for high-throughput, low-latency traffic control with per-tenant isolation.

## Key Concepts
- eBPF maps and per-tenant state
- XDP, native mode, and fast path decisions
- Token bucket rate limiting and atomic operations
- Live map updates and safety/OOM considerations
- Observability: bpftool, perf, and counters

